    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>戶籍地址</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□□□　縣市　鄉鎮市區　村里　鄰　路街　段　巷弄　號樓</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>居住地址</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□同戶籍地址</text:p><text:p>□□□　縣市　鄉鎮市區　村里　鄰　路街　段　巷弄　號樓</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>公文送達地址</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□同戶籍地址　□同居住地址</text:p><text:p>□□□　縣市　鄉鎮市區　村里　鄰　路街　段　巷弄　號樓</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
