    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>傳真</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>電子信箱</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>教育程度</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□1.不識字□2.幼兒園　□3.小學□4.國中　□5.高中（職）</text:p><text:p>□6.專科□7.大學 □8.碩士（含以上）</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>職業狀況</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□1.農林漁牧　□2.工礦　□3.商　□4.軍公教　□5.服務業</text:p><text:p>□6.自由業　　7.無（□在學　□不在學）□8.其他:_______</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
    <table:table-row><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>居住狀況</text:p></table:table-cell><table:table-cell table:style-name="Cell"><text:p>□1.獨居　□2.與家屬同住</text:p><text:p>□3.機構名稱：____　□4.其他:__________</text:p></table:table-cell></table:table-row>
